      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "If it matters for this bug, I became exempted from world discovery personalization with a legal right to object under General Data Protection Regulation (\"GDPR\") in support tickets [#699784](https://help.vrchat.com/hc/en-us/requests/699784) and [#713959](https://help.vrchat.com/hc/en-us/requests/713959) two months prior. The algorithm is supposedly suggesting me generic worlds instead of personalized ones based on historical data.\n\nIn other words, I'm on the opt-out (exemption) list for personalized recommendations. @{64873f159cf028090ce2c2e2|full_name}",
